          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"data\":[{\"id\":\"52921bac-cdc4-40ef-9b1a-5d08cfe12d2e\",\"target\":\"event\",\"name\":\"Coffeehouse Cinema Vol. 9\",\"type\":\"manual\",\"description\":\"<p><strong>Coffeehouse Cinema is back for Vol. 9.</strong></p><p>Join us for an evening of great movies, meaningful conversation, and connection with filmmakers and fellow film lovers.</p><p>Coffeehouse Cinema is built around a simple idea: films are better when we experience them together. Every screening brings new stories, new filmmakers, and new people into the room, creating a space for discovery, conversation, and community.</p><p>Curated short films. Watched together.<br></p><p><strong>What to Expect</strong></p><p>Come early, grab a drink, and settle in with fellow filmmakers and film lovers before the screening begins.</p><p>At 8:00 PM, we’ll kick off a curated program of short films selected by Coffeehouse Cinema. After the films, stick around for conversation with the filmmakers and the people behind the work.</p><p>The evening is designed to feel less like a traditional theater screening and more like gathering with a room full of people who genuinely love movies.<br></p><p><strong>Expect:</strong></p><ul><li><p>A thoughtfully curated selection of short films</p></li><li><p>Time to meet filmmakers, creatives, and fellow film lovers</p></li><li><p>Conversation and filmmaker Q&amp;A following the screening</p></li><li><p>Drinks and a relaxed atmosphere at Re/creation Cafe</p></li><li><p>Plenty of time to hang out and connect before and after the films</p></li></ul><p></p><p><strong>Come for the movies. Stay for the conversation.</strong><br></p><p><strong>Event Details</strong></p><p>Thursday, September 17th<br><br>Re/creation Cafe<br>4510 W Washington Blvd<br>Los Angeles, CA 90016</p><p>Doors Open: 7:00 PM<br>Screening Begins: 8:00 PM</p>\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-02T21:28:04.371Z\",\"locations\":[{\"id\":\"b2ed9bcf-59fa-4762-bdea-5208d381f52c\",\"address\":\"4510 West Washington Boulevard, Los Angeles, CA, USA\",\"locationName\":\"Re/creation Cafe\",\"latitude\":34.03963,\"longitude\":-118.33806}],\"startDate\":\"2026-09-17T19:00:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-17T22:30:00.000\",\"timeZone\":\"America/Los_Angeles\",\"timeZoneAbbreviation\":\"PDT\",\"image\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2F8bb72475-1966-4246-b0b5-0a6b960b3af4%2Fc258955c-fa10-4663-8843-7afef0ff8131%2F420b1167-7c8b-4a74-8ec2-7ef2f67e1259.webp\",\"company\":{\"id\":\"55f5cb38-2302-4b1f-9e60-3f41e966f933\",\"name\":\"Coffeehouse Cinema\",\"image\":{\"filePath\":\"companies/55f5cb38-2302-4b1f-9e60-3f41e966f933/ebe2c84e-5215-4636-b5e0-f0321652439c.webp\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2F55f5cb38-2302-4b1f-9e60-3f41e966f933%2Febe2c84e-5215-4636-b5e0-f0321652439c.webp\"},\"url\":null},\"events\":[],\"city\":{\"id\":\"9bef24ec-2a3e-41e6-80ad-39edbe889eed\",\"name\":\"Los Angeles\",\"country\":\"USA\",\"timeZone\":\"America/Los_Angeles\",\"longitude\":-118.242643,\"latitude\":34.0549076},\"slug\":\"coffeehouse-cinema-vol-9\",\"membersCount\":0,\"photos\":[]},{\"id\":\"28338155-c33c-455d-af10-adfd5a68cd9d\",\"target\":\"event\",\"name\":\"Coffeehouse Cinema London\",\"type\":\"manual\",\"description\":\"<p><strong>Coffeehouse Cinema is coming to London.</strong></p><p>Join us for an evening of great movies, meaningful conversation, and connection with filmmakers and fellow film lovers.</p><p>Coffeehouse Cinema is built around a simple idea: films are better when we experience them together. Every screening brings new stories, new filmmakers, and new people into the room, creating a space for discovery, conversation, and community.</p><p>For the first time, we’re bringing that experience to London.<br></p><p><strong>Curated short films. Watched together.</strong><br></p><p><strong>What to Expect</strong></p><p>Come early, grab a drink, and settle in with fellow filmmakers and film lovers before the screening begins.<br></p><p>At 7:00 PM, we’ll kick off a curated program of short films selected by Coffeehouse Cinema. After the films, stick around for conversation with the filmmakers and the people behind the work.<br></p><p>The evening is designed to feel less like a traditional theater screening and more like gathering with a room full of people who genuinely love movies.<br></p><p><strong>Expect:</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>A thoughtfully curated selection of short films</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Time to meet filmmakers, creatives, and fellow film lovers</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Conversation and filmmaker Q&amp;A following the screening</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>A relaxed atmosphere at Mason &amp; Fifth</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Plenty of time to hang out and connect before and after the films</strong></p></li></ul><p></p><p><strong>Come for the movies. Stay for the conversation.</strong><br></p><p><strong>Event Details</strong></p><p><strong>Wednesday, September 23rd</strong></p><p><strong>Mason &amp; Fifth, Westbourne Park</strong><br>11 Woodfield Road<br>London W9 2BA<br>United Kingdom</p><p></p><p><strong>Doors Open: 6:30 PM</strong><br><strong>Screening Begins: 7:00 PM</strong><br></p><p><strong>Tickets: £15</strong></p>\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-03T12:53:44.141Z\",\"locations\":[{\"id\":\"4bb7aec3-76da-4104-b490-c5795a7dc34b\",\"address\":\"11 Woodfield Road, London, UK\",\"locationName\":\"Mason & Fifth, Westbourne Park\",\"latitude\":51.52295969999999,\"longitude\":-0.1995926}],\"startDate\":\"2026-09-23T18:30:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-23T22:30:00.000\",\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"timeZoneAbbreviation\":\"BST\",\"image\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2F28338155-c33c-455d-af10-adfd5a68cd9d%2F452aee7c-aae4-4f87-8061-05553ae9ca69%2F5de99053-2449-48e3-8692-c5f0c9d2208c.webp\",\"company\":{\"id\":\"55f5cb38-2302-4b1f-9e60-3f41e966f933\",\"name\":\"Coffeehouse Cinema\",\"image\":{\"filePath\":\"companies/55f5cb38-2302-4b1f-9e60-3f41e966f933/ebe2c84e-5215-4636-b5e0-f0321652439c.webp\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2F55f5cb38-2302-4b1f-9e60-3f41e966f933%2Febe2c84e-5215-4636-b5e0-f0321652439c.webp\"},\"url\":null},\"events\":[],\"city\":{\"id\":\"ef6c2cc0-ef51-4f87-8835-ae615b6b7841\",\"name\":\"London\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"longitude\":-0.1275862,\"latitude\":51.5072178},\"slug\":\"coffeehouse-cinema-london\",\"membersCount\":0,\"photos\":[]}],\"pagination\":{\"pageSize\":50,\"page\":1,\"total\":2,\"totalPages\":1}}",
