            "text": "{\"id\":\"52921bac-cdc4-40ef-9b1a-5d08cfe12d2e\",\"target\":\"event\",\"eventType\":\"manual\",\"isPrivate\":false,\"isTransferEnabled\":false,\"name\":\"Coffeehouse Cinema Vol. 9\",\"description\":\"<p><strong>Coffeehouse Cinema is back for Vol. 9.</strong></p><p>Join us for an evening of great movies, meaningful conversation, and connection with filmmakers and fellow film lovers.</p><p>Coffeehouse Cinema is built around a simple idea: films are better when we experience them together. Every screening brings new stories, new filmmakers, and new people into the room, creating a space for discovery, conversation, and community.</p><p>Curated short films. Watched together.<br></p><p><strong>What to Expect</strong></p><p>Come early, grab a drink, and settle in with fellow filmmakers and film lovers before the screening begins.</p><p>At 8:00 PM, we’ll kick off a curated program of short films selected by Coffeehouse Cinema. After the films, stick around for conversation with the filmmakers and the people behind the work.</p><p>The evening is designed to feel less like a traditional theater screening and more like gathering with a room full of people who genuinely love movies.<br></p><p><strong>Expect:</strong></p><ul><li><p>A thoughtfully curated selection of short films</p></li><li><p>Time to meet filmmakers, creatives, and fellow film lovers</p></li><li><p>Conversation and filmmaker Q&amp;A following the screening</p></li><li><p>Drinks and a relaxed atmosphere at Re/creation Cafe</p></li><li><p>Plenty of time to hang out and connect before and after the films</p></li></ul><p></p><p><strong>Come for the movies. Stay for the conversation.</strong><br></p><p><strong>Event Details</strong></p><p>Thursday, September 17th<br><br>Re/creation Cafe<br>4510 W Washington Blvd<br>Los Angeles, CA 90016</p><p>Doors Open: 7:00 PM<br>Screening Begins: 8:00 PM</p>\",\"salesStartDate\":null,\"startDate\":\"2026-09-17T19:00:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-17T22:30:00